{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover many characters with their own  set of runes and cards and challenges. Prepare to dive into the world of Unbound Eternity, a <strong>turn-based combat game with deck-building features</strong> where you\u2019re not the hero <strong>BUT a MONSTER</strong>, invading the lands owned by a mysterious cult of &quot;the eye&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/character_choice.gif?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2_EN.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the army of the empress with your runes and cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by &quot;the eye&quot;. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/fight.gif?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/3_EN.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the battles you want\u00a0and collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/chose_your_path.gif?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/4_EN.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine tiles, gather artifacts, upgrade and craft your cards to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use runes to play your cards and create combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies or sacrifice your own health to make powerful attacks!  Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_haut.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/manage_inventory.gif?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/inter_bas.png?t=1749839389\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/5_EN.png?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/reward.gif?t=1749839389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All the cards are in your hand, so are you up to it?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274090?t=1749839389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/a1b71f0a616b99e877b4651a1ac5f52371444259/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749839389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/f53985976c6bb1fc9625238a289fbbd9392d8f7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749839389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/f53985976c6bb1fc9625238a289fbbd9392d8f7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749839389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Soun